msgid "PassWall Settings"
msgstr "PassWall 设置"

msgid "PassWall mode scans uci show passwall and updates nodes whose address matches the target domain with optimized IPs."
msgstr "PassWall 模式扫描 uci show passwall，将 address 匹配目标域名的节点替换为优选 IP。"

