msgid "Prepend this URL to GitHub download links. Useful in mainland China. Leave empty for direct downloads. Must end with /."
msgstr "在 GitHub 下载链接前拼接此 URL。中国大陆网络环境可用。留空直接从 GitHub 下载。必须以 / 结尾。"

